#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:5
#: 974328f26be84c96b33016ddfae41599
msgid "Hargrave Technologies DroneCAN ESCs"
msgstr "Hargrave Technologies DroneCAN ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:9
#: 366c58d5ec2a45e78afbbe1e8ee07bf4
msgid ""
"Hargrave Technologies is an Australian power electronics engineering company"
" specialising in the professional design and manufacturing of NDAA-compliant"
" electronic speed controllers (ESCs)."
msgstr ""
"Hargrave Technologies 是一家澳大利亚电力电子工程公司，专注于符合 NDAA 要求的电子调速器（ESC）的专业设计和制造。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:11
#: a43805b1592848a99a39fa0ac0561229
msgid ""
"Hargrave's ESCs are designed for space and weight-limited applications and "
"optimised for power density while maintaining optimum thermal performance. "
"`The full range can be found here "
"<https://www.hargravetechnologies.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
"Hargrave 的 ESC 专为空间和重量受限的应用场景设计，在保持最优热性能的同时优化功率密度。`完整产品系列请见此处 "
"<https://www.hargravetechnologies.com/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:13
#: d0563dce03a84397be1dd54b480ffde4
msgid ""
"The ESCs support DroneCAN natively, providing an interface for control, "
"telemetry, parameter configuration and firmware updates. The following guide"
" describes how to get set up and outlines the main features of the DroneCAN "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"这些 ESC 原生支持 DroneCAN，提供控制、遥测、参数配置和固件更新接口。以下指南介绍如何完成设置，并概述 DroneCAN 接口的主要功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:17
#: cce3b5f02ff9405b84abe247890c0196
msgid "Ardupilot Setup"
msgstr "ArduPilot 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:18
#: 3fa2bd2604594171bc08df6ac9f879b9
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions for DroneCAN setup found at :ref:`DroneCAN ESCs "
"<common-uavcan-escs>` - specifically, the parameters required for the "
"autopilot to activate the DroneCAN driver on the desired physical port."
msgstr ""
"请按照 :ref:`DroneCAN ESCs <common-uavcan-escs>` 中的 DroneCAN "
"设置说明操作——具体来说，是飞控在所需物理端口上激活 DroneCAN 驱动程序所需的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:22
#: dc930b2b005c4eceb7a67019fb3a2b23
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "入门指南"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:23
#: 267e61fd643b4ea986bb215a861c0e7d
msgid ""
"By default, the ESCs will accept a CAN Bus communications input. The ESCs "
"can be configured over USB or CAN Bus. `A USB configuration tool for "
"settings, onboard log view and firmware updates can be found here "
"<https://configurator.hargravetechnologies.com>`__."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，ESC 接受 CAN 总线通信输入。ESC 可通过 USB 或 CAN 总线进行配置。`USB "
"配置工具（用于设置、板载日志查看和固件更新）可在此处获取 "
"<https://configurator.hargravetechnologies.com>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:27
#: 652053e2a4aa404c8df369ed20085bbf
msgid ""
"To enable CAN, the `CAN Bus Enabled "
"<https://docs.hargravetechnologies.com/communication-settings>`__ setting "
"should be set as required. The settings names are abbreviated for CAN "
"transmissions."
msgstr ""
"要启用 CAN，应按需设置 `CAN 总线启用 "
"<https://docs.hargravetechnologies.com/communication-settings>`__ 选项。设置名称在 "
"CAN 传输中有缩写。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:29
#: e4d87dd15bf244c89059703ab6e23c05
msgid ""
"When running DroneCAN, it's recommended to set the DroneCAN Node ID as "
"required by the system, noting there should be no duplicates. By default, "
"Hargrave ESCs will seek a Node ID automatically (the flight controller will "
"negotiate and provide one through dynamic node allocation). However, this "
"can result in changing IDs over time. The following ESC settings will change"
" this behaviour:"
msgstr ""
"运行 DroneCAN 时，建议按系统要求设置 DroneCAN 节点 ID，注意不得有重复。默认情况下，Hargrave ESC 会自动寻找节点 "
"ID（飞控通过动态节点分配协商并提供一个 ID）。但这可能导致 ID 随时间变化。以下 ESC 设置可改变此行为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:31
#: 102e44871d1f4906a734a120c5f4c777
msgid ""
"``Force DroneCAN Node ID (FORCE_NODEID)``:  Toggles the method that the ESC "
"uses to get an ID."
msgstr "``Force DroneCAN Node ID (FORCE_NODEID)``：切换 ESC 获取 ID 的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:32
#: 45ddf952d94a4442846a2e7bf144b886
msgid ""
"``Preferred DroneCAN Node ID (DRONECAN_NODEID)``:  Set the desired Node ID. "
"The ESC will use this ID when the Force Node ID parameter is enabled."
msgstr ""
"``Preferred DroneCAN Node ID (DRONECAN_NODEID)``：设置所需的节点 ID。启用 Force Node ID"
" 参数时，ESC 将使用此 ID。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:34
#: 5202dc7c3c9246c0a9ea7513e6886e7e
msgid ""
"Further settings that should be considered (more documentation can be found "
"`here <https://docs.hargravetechnologies.com/can-bus-settings>`__):"
msgstr ""
"需要考虑的其他设置（更多文档可`在此处 <https://docs.hargravetechnologies.com/can-bus-"
"settings>`__ 找到）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:36
#: cd24c226e9c94378b77aa0c8b6f34a63
msgid ""
"``DroneCAN ESC Index (DRONECAN_INDEX)``:  Configures which motor output the "
"ESC will use from the flight controller. The channels are 0 indexed, so "
"Motor 1 on the flight controller is ``ESC Index`` = 0."
msgstr ""
"``DroneCAN ESC Index (DRONECAN_INDEX)``：配置 ESC 将使用飞控的哪个电机输出。通道从 0 "
"开始索引，因此飞控的电机 1 对应 ``ESC Index`` = 0。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:37
#: f1a2b142c65b43cfbe08ee607ac29fc7
msgid ""
"``Require Armed Status DroneCAN (CAN_ARM_CHK_EN)``:  By default, the ESC "
"will only drive the motor while the Autopilot broadcasts that it is in an "
"Armed state. Toggle this setting to change the behaviour."
msgstr ""
"``Require Armed Status DroneCAN (CAN_ARM_CHK_EN)``：默认情况下，ESC "
"仅在飞控广播处于解锁状态时才驱动电机。切换此设置可改变此行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:38
#: bd4fc50555d4410f844791e80e3fc688
msgid ""
"``CAN Terminator Enable (CAN_TERM_EN)``:  The onboard software-selectable "
"CAN termination resistor can be enabled by toggling this setting. Follow the"
" connection tips below to select which ESC to enable this on, as it should "
"only be enabled on a single unit per bus."
msgstr ""
"``CAN Terminator Enable (CAN_TERM_EN)``：可通过切换此设置来启用板载软件可选的 CAN "
"终端电阻。请按照以下连接说明选择在哪个 ESC 上启用，因为每条总线只应在一个单元上启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:41
#: eccaa79b40064afcac9102b1d07d808e
msgid "Connecting the ESCs"
msgstr "连接 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:42
#: f304e485c52b41faaafddd375123b6ff
msgid ""
"Each ESC should be connected in a daisy chain configuration, where one end "
"of the chain is the flight controller, and the other is an ESC."
msgstr "每个 ESC 应以菊花链方式连接，链的一端为飞控，另一端为 ESC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:46
#: 0df2b8b2295647399702313fb1268c31
msgid ""
"Ensure the flight controller is appropriately terminated. For example, "
"models such as the Pixhawk Cube have CAN termination resistors installed by "
"default."
msgstr "确保飞控已正确终端。例如，Pixhawk Cube 等型号默认安装了 CAN 终端电阻。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:48
#: 5c6b98b3e1ac401c99d09bc046341ab0
msgid ""
"The CAN H, CAN L and GND should be connected to the flight controller ports "
"in the same order."
msgstr "CAN H、CAN L 和 GND 应按相同顺序连接到飞控端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:52
#: 3818cb5fc0ea43299735e907e2d791c3
msgid ""
"The ESCs have a software-selectable CAN termination resistor for ease of "
"integration, which should be enabled on the ESC that is physically furthest "
"along the daisy chain (in reference to the flight controller)."
msgstr "ESC 配备软件可选的 CAN 终端电阻以便于集成，应在菊花链中物理位置最远的 ESC（相对于飞控而言）上启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:54
#: a412588557b84939b1dbf54c7e0fec38
msgid ""
"The following diagram shows the wiring of the CAN lines communicating from "
"the flight controller, and terminating on the final ESC (which should have "
"the terminator activated):"
msgstr "下图展示了从飞控到最终 ESC（应激活终端）之间 CAN 线路的接线方式："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:59
#: 17ce7f43afb842df9e5cfc6aaaffe32d
msgid "Logging and Reporting"
msgstr "日志记录与报告"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:61
#: 57bbc95b22d240a5a90650712365fd15
msgid ""
"The ESCs support telemetry reporting directly to the autopilot, for viewing "
"and logging purposes. Ardupilot log viewing tools can be used to view this "
"data. The ESCs support two different telemetry messages which can be "
"individually configured as required, transmitting the following data:"
msgstr ""
"ESC 支持直接向飞控报告遥测数据，用于查看和日志记录。可使用 ArduPilot 日志查看工具查看这些数据。ESC "
"支持两种遥测消息，可根据需要单独配置，传输以下数据："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:64
#: a027d96eebba4d298ff891a8e964cd20
msgid "ESC Primary Status"
msgstr "ESC 主要状态"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:65
#: 22ead77359374d819306f97f6ce7c907
msgid "Error Count:  Current active errors on the ESC. 0 indicates no errors."
msgstr "错误计数：ESC 当前活跃错误数。0 表示无错误。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:66
#: a65aa929d6644a229e881f278baab165
msgid "Voltage:  The bus voltage currently measured."
msgstr "电压：当前测量的总线电压。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:67
#: 1aa6cc6dfb4844299d384141fadc8abb
msgid "Current:  The bus current currently measured."
msgstr "电流：当前测量的总线电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:68
#: b8cff0580e74431fbdea627b53346e01
msgid "Temperature:  The bridge temperature currently measured."
msgstr "温度：当前测量的桥臂温度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:69
#: 2018d4af41cb42a38f1a80953379c369
msgid ""
"RPM:  The RPM of the motor, scaled with the ``Motor Pole Pair`` parameter on"
" the ESC."
msgstr "转速：电机的 RPM，使用 ESC 上的 ``Motor Pole Pair`` 参数进行换算。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:70
#: fca2006b094344938f503228bad64fcb
msgid ""
"Requested Power:  The percentage power currently requested by the autopilot."
msgstr "请求功率：飞控当前请求的功率百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:74
#: c0786062f4804de6bfa9b314a22755c9
msgid "ESC Extended Status"
msgstr "ESC 扩展状态"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:75
#: 77fcf195500f40178af877c1d8ca588e
msgid ""
"Input Percent:  The percentage duty cycle currently requested by the "
"autopilot."
msgstr "输入百分比：飞控当前请求的占空比百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:76
#: 42758bdda5a64f6582c314629ef3474e
msgid ""
"Output Percent:  The percentage duty cycle currently output to the motor. If"
" not equal to input percent, this indicates limiting is occuring within the "
"ESC."
msgstr "输出百分比：当前输出到电机的占空比百分比。若与输入百分比不同，则表示 ESC 内部正在进行限幅。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:77
#: 7123748d803a40f19dcd53af66c4be94
msgid ""
"Motor Temperature:  The temperature of the connected motor (requires NTC or "
"PTC sensor connected to the ESC)."
msgstr "电机温度：连接电机的温度（需要连接到 ESC 的 NTC 或 PTC 传感器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:78
#: c1da2ed74b06451e848d6d94204dcefd
msgid ""
"Motor Angle:  The currently measured angle of the motor, if sensor input is "
"enabled. (requires external motor position sensing)."
msgstr "电机角度：如果启用了传感器输入，则为当前测量的电机角度（需要外部电机位置传感）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:79
#: 55c9fda8b9ed40149ceea8a7f622cf2d
msgid ""
"Status Flags:  The current general status of the ESC, non-error specific."
msgstr "状态标志：ESC 当前通用状态，非错误专项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:82
#: b206dbeea655427b9fdcce7fbef90f53
msgid ""
"Both status messages are individually transmitted, and the rate can be "
"adjusted separately as required. The rate of transmission should be "
"minimised such that the CAN bus is not overloaded."
msgstr "两种状态消息单独传输，可根据需要分别调整传输速率。应将传输速率降至最低，以免 CAN 总线过载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:85
#: db618ca0ec5b404da2d8801c3ed7ad1d
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:87
#: 00f47f98855d434cbdf1253d1e0f0d23
msgid ""
"The ESCs support parameter/setting configuration over DroneCAN. The ESC will"
" reboot to apply the updates to the parameters. By default, not all settings"
" are shown. To show all available parameters on the ESC, enable the "
"``Advanced Settings`` parameter (the ESC will require a reboot to apply and "
"allow fetching of all parameters). Once set, this setting will persist until"
" changed again."
msgstr ""
"ESC 支持通过 DroneCAN 进行参数/设置配置。ESC 将重启以应用参数更新。默认情况下并非所有设置都会显示。要显示 ESC "
"上的所有可用参数，请启用 ``Advanced Settings`` 参数（ESC "
"需要重启以应用并允许获取所有参数）。设置后，该设置将持续保留直至再次更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:91
#: 9cb721f33a5d4e4dbfacc5542db65982
msgid ""
"If CAN is disabled, USB access is required to configure the ESC from serial "
"signalling mode back into CAN."
msgstr "如果 CAN 被禁用，则需要通过 USB 访问将 ESC 从串行信号模式重新配置回 CAN 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:93
#: ecaa98282ba04924a6c2f8c2e11dd569
msgid ""
"The ESC will reject attempts to fetch or save parameters while the motor is "
"running (or the ESC is in the motor driving state). To perform further "
"updates, either disarm the motors (assuming the ``Require Armed Status "
"DroneCAN`` parameter is enabled) or disable the ESC throttle packet output "
"from the flight controller. Rebooting the ESC will also allow for parameter "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"当电机运行时（或 ESC 处于电机驱动状态），ESC 将拒绝获取或保存参数的尝试。要执行进一步更新，可上锁电机（假设已启用 ``Require "
"Armed Status DroneCAN`` 参数）或禁用飞控的 ESC 油门数据包输出。重启 ESC 也允许进行参数更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:95
#: 60aa1c623f2a43d0a4a99e31ec3e6013
msgid ""
"The ``Erase All`` function within DroneCAN will reset the configuration to "
"the default state, and automatically trigger a reboot to apply the settings."
msgstr "DroneCAN 中的 ``Erase All`` 功能会将配置重置为默认状态，并自动触发重启以应用设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:98
#: e29bdbb6e177488493c3a0672d64e479
msgid "Firmware Updates"
msgstr "固件更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:100
#: 315f80c3d74b4bd6848e573676b4a0b7
msgid ""
"The ESCs support firmware updating over DroneCAN. Once the firmware update "
"process has started, the ESC will report file read and update status through"
" the DroneCAN debug messages. The ESCs automatically check the file for "
"compatibility before the update starts."
msgstr ""
"ESC 支持通过 DroneCAN 进行固件更新。固件更新过程开始后，ESC 将通过 DroneCAN 调试消息报告文件读取和更新状态。ESC "
"在更新开始前会自动检查文件兼容性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:102
#: ab1693eda0bf439ea791ff9b365efe16
msgid ""
"Once the firmware is successfully downloaded, the unit will automatically "
"verify and perform the firmware installation, followed by a reboot."
msgstr "固件成功下载后，设备将自动验证并执行固件安装，然后重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:106
#: fe5d63b86a344e0d9df726729e1d5b97
msgid ""
"The ESCs have a built in recovery in the event the update process is "
"interrupted or fails to complete. If an issue occurs, reboot the unit and "
"restart the update attempt. The previous firmware version is retained in the"
" event of interruption."
msgstr "ESC 内置了在更新过程中断或未能完成时的恢复机制。如发生问题，请重启设备并重新尝试更新。中断情况下会保留上一个固件版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:108
#: d6855575d76543589f2cd3c99fe944a7
msgid ""
"The firmware can be updated through the DroneCAN GUI or other DroneCAN-"
"supported interfaces (such as Mission Planner). The image below highlights "
"some key DroneCAN GUI features; double-click on a node to open the node "
"properties panel:"
msgstr ""
"固件可通过 DroneCAN GUI 或其他支持 DroneCAN 的接口（如 Mission Planner）进行更新。下图重点展示了一些 "
"DroneCAN GUI 关键功能；双击节点可打开节点属性面板："

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:112
#: dc14d9b86ddf4d07a6065638cb1a720e
msgid ""
"After a firmware update is complete and the unit reboots, confirm the "
"reported firmware version matches expectations."
msgstr "固件更新完成且设备重启后，确认报告的固件版本符合预期。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:115
#: 6dcaeafef15840758dc4b8601ba5947c
msgid "Further Information"
msgstr "更多信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-hargrave-dronecan-escs.rst:117
#: 32c6b8735613407391bf9a7e0881889c
msgid ""
"Hargrave Technologies prides itself on industry-leading support. If you have"
" further questions or need assistance, reach out to the team `here "
"<https://www.hargravetechnologies.com/contact>`__. All support topics are "
"channelled directly to the engineering team."
msgstr ""
"Hargrave Technologies 以业界领先的支持为傲。如有进一步问题或需要帮助，请`在此处 "
"<https://www.hargravetechnologies.com/contact>`__ 联系团队。所有支持事项均直接由工程团队处理。"
